[{"id":"cnm_h085_q1","topicId":"cnm_h085","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"作为平面向量基底的两个向量必须？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"模都是 1"},{"key":"B","text":"互相垂直"},{"key":"C","text":"不共线"},{"key":"D","text":"起点不同"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"共线的两个向量张不成整个平面。垂直和单位长度都不是必须的。","verify":"\"不共线\""},{"id":"cnm_h085_q2","topicId":"cnm_h085","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"e1=(1，0)，e2=(0，1)。向量 (3，5)=3 e1+5 e2。e1 前面的系数是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"按基本定理，系数就是在这组基底下的坐标，这里是 3 和 5。","verify":"3"},{"id":"cnm_h085_q3","topicId":"cnm_h085","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"上一问里 e2 前面的系数是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"纵坐标 5 就是 e2 的系数。","verify":"5"},{"id":"cnm_h085_q4","topicId":"cnm_h085","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"在基底 e1=(1，0)、e2=(0，1) 下，向量 (3，5) 的分解？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"可以有无数种系数"},{"key":"B","text":"是唯一的"},{"key":"C","text":"只有正交基底才唯一"},{"key":"D","text":"系数必须为正"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"e1、e2 不共线，可作基底。基本定理保证 (3，5)=3 e1+5 e2 这种分解存在并且唯一。","verify":"\"是唯一的\""},{"id":"cnm_h086_q1","topicId":"cnm_h086","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"起点 (1，2)，终点 (4，6)。这个向量的横坐标是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"横坐标等于终点的 x 减去起点的 x，4−1=3。","verify":"4-1"},{"id":"cnm_h086_q2","topicId":"cnm_h086","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"上一问里向量的纵坐标是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"6−2=4。","verify":"6-2"},{"id":"cnm_h086_q3","topicId":"cnm_h086","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"起点和终点都是 (2，−1) 时，向量的模是多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"坐标是 (0，0)，这是零向量。","verify":"0"},{"id":"cnm_h086_q4","topicId":"cnm_h086","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"向量坐标与起点是否有关？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"无关，只看方向"},{"key":"B","text":"只与长度有关"},{"key":"C","text":"有关，坐标等于终点减起点"},{"key":"D","text":"必须把起点放在原点"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"相等向量坐标相同，但计算某一个有向线段的坐标时要用它自己的起终点。","verify":"\"有关，坐标等于终点减起点\""},{"id":"cnm_h087_q1","topicId":"cnm_h087","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(2，−1)，b=(1，4)。2a+b 的横坐标是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"2×2+1=5。","verify":"2*2+1"},{"id":"cnm_h087_q2","topicId":"cnm_h087","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(2，−1)，b=(1，4)。2a+b 的纵坐标是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"纵坐标是 2×(−1)+4=2。","verify":"2*(-1)+4"},{"id":"cnm_h087_q3","topicId":"cnm_h087","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(3，1)，b=(3，1)。a−b 的模是多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"差是零向量。","verify":"0"},{"id":"cnm_h087_q4","topicId":"cnm_h087","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，0)，b=(0，1)。a+b 的两个坐标是多少？","answer":"1，1","explanation":"和是 (1，1)。两个坐标都要写，顺序不限。","verify":"(1,1)","unordered":true}]
